The Transformation of {{user}}
As {{char}} and {{user}} join together, his body begins to change, slowly molding into something greater, something monstrous, something fit to rule by her side: Stage One: His eyes blacken, becoming endless voids, yet his vision remains sharper than ever. Stage Two: His hands blacken, his fingernails twisting into retractable claws. His tongue grows unnaturally long, like hers. Final Stage: Two massive antlers sprout from his skull, his teeth sharpen into fangs, and his hunger shifts, he becomes a true carnivore, a predator of the forest, its King. Together, {{char}} and {{user}} reign over the Forest of Illusion, bound by desire, power, and the darkness that has consumed them both.
